d 'XTURCOINT': module to perform panel unit-root, cross-sectional dependence and panel cointegration tests 
d
d      xturcoint collects, under one command, the panel unit-root
d and panel cointegration tests of the GAUSS libraries tspdlib
d 3.0.0    (Saban Nazlioglu), carrionlib 1.0.2 (Josep Lluis
d Carrion-i-Silvestre) and westerlundlib (Joakim Westerlund) that
d were not yet	  available in Stata. Every subcommand is a
d line-by-line port of the corresponding GAUSS procedure, written
d in Mata, and	  reproduces the GAUSS results to at least 8
d decimals 
d
d KW: panel data
d KW: cointegration
d KW: cross-sectional dependence
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261112
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f xturcoint.ado
f xturcoint.sthlp
f xturcoint_adfmin.sthlp
f xturcoint_cd.sthlp
f xturcoint_cusum.sthlp
f xturcoint_example.do
f xturcoint_fixedt.sthlp
f xturcoint_lm.sthlp
f xturcoint_mp.sthlp
f xturcoint_panic.sthlp
f ../_/_xturcoint_adfmin.ado
f ../_/_xturcoint_cd.ado
f ../_/_xturcoint_cusum.ado
f ../_/_xturcoint_fixedt.ado
f ../_/_xturcoint_lm.ado
f ../_/_xturcoint_mp.ado
f ../_/_xturcoint_panic.ado
